Specification FizzBuzz

DataType Output
Description Possible outputs of the program
Examples: OutputExamples
| Output   |
| 1        |
| Fizz     |
| Buzz     |
| FizzBuzz |

Attributes OutputExamples
| Attribute | DataType |
| Output    | String   |

Attributes FizzBuzzCases
| Name   | DataType |
| Number | Integer  |
| Result | Output   |

Calculation Non-Multiples Return Number
Description Returns the number when it is not divisible by three or five.
Examples: FizzBuzzCases
| Number | Result |
| 1      | 1      |
| 2      | 2      |
| 4      | 4      |
| 7      | 7      |
| 8      | 8      |

Calculation Multiples Of Three Return Fizz
Description Returns Fizz when the number is divisible by three and not by five.
Examples: FizzBuzzCases
| Number | Result |
| 3      | Fizz   |
| 6      | Fizz   |
| 9      | Fizz   |
| 12     | Fizz   |

Calculation Multiples Of Five Return Buzz
Description Returns Buzz when the number is divisible by five and not by three.
Examples: FizzBuzzCases
| Number | Result |
| 5      | Buzz   |
| 10     | Buzz   |
| 20     | Buzz   |
| 25     | Buzz   |

Calculation Multiples Of Three And Five Return FizzBuzz
Description Returns FizzBuzz when the number is divisible by both three and five.
Examples: FizzBuzzCases
| Number | Result   |
| 15     | FizzBuzz |
| 30     | FizzBuzz |
| 45     | FizzBuzz |
| 60     | FizzBuzz |

Calculation Values One Through Fifteen
Description Demonstrates the complete FizzBuzz sequence from one through fifteen.
Examples: FizzBuzzCases
| Number | Result   |
| 1      | 1        |
| 2      | 2        |
| 3      | Fizz     |
| 4      | 4        |
| 5      | Buzz     |
| 6      | Fizz     |
| 7      | 7        |
| 8      | 8        |
| 9      | Fizz     |
| 10     | Buzz     |
| 11     | 11       |
| 12     | Fizz     |
| 13     | 13       |
| 14     | 14       |
| 15     | FizzBuzz |